  "sourceTitle": "I clustered two old Android phones to run a 27B LLM locally. Bypassed RAM limits via C++ RPC split and Hadamard Ternary…",
  "sourceBodyHash": "66ae73274c877f7afb32800dcabf3b3a69ae81a7e130ea1f28b5a78fab5c95db",
