  "totalBlocks": 16,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "228e168c10e68bf3",
      "translationZh": "我在这里看到不少帖子，有人在努力用 8GB VRAM 跑 27B 模型，也有人抱怨手机变成了电暖器。我在自己的手机上也撞上了同样的 OOM 障碍，于是决定构建一个将计算拆分到多台硬件上的变通方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89f128a76a3598fe",
      "translationZh": "我编写了一个自定义 C++ 引擎（llama.rn 的分支），用一根普通的 USB 线将两部 Android 手机组成集群。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1deb947318a7611",
      "translationZh": "配置与性能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e15f7f4a8d02e46",
      "translationZh": "模型：Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B（压缩至 2.06 bpw / 6.52 GiB）。困惑度：14.26（参考值为 14.05）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b2c87c50a147f4c4",
      "translationZh": "集群模式（Xiaomi redme 100 pro max + ROG 7）：模型层按 4.36 GiB / 2.15 GiB 拆分，通过 USB 线使用自定义 RPC 通信。速度：约 2.8 tok/s（受较慢的那部手机限制，但同步完全一致）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "36fed063e8974a7f",
      "translationZh": "单机模式（仅使用 Xiaomi 15）：文本生成速度为 5.6 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5137b931cfb2b25",
      "translationZh": "独门秘诀（为什么它不会把手机熔掉）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c64feb390ce3786f",
      "translationZh": "我没有使用标准量化。权重在经过 Hadamard 旋转的基底中是三值的（-1, 0, 1）。我没有离线撤销旋转（那样会破坏 2-bit 原始表示），而是让权重保持折叠状态存储在 GGUF 中，并编写了一个补丁，在运行时于设备的 ARM CPU 上应用 Hadamard 变换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ef8f5ad8ce0fcf2",
      "translationZh": "结果：只有加法/减法。MAC 运算次数为零。最高温度在 30°C 左右。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce53c00383b78b18",
      "translationZh": "🎥 原始演示（2 分 45 秒，一镜到底）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27b0dfea2ee701a6",
      "translationZh": "📊 引擎日志：https://gist.github.com/figkcoci-debug/76f41c409fc5afe5a431094cc228ddc0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5d637300b87a9f1",
      "translationZh": "📄 方法说明：https://gist.github.com/figkcoci-debug/11871f60812d2d18de5214fda3d94160",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "092270911bc16b9e",
      "translationZh": "我是一名高中生，目前正在寻找实验室研究机会/资助，以进一步推进这项工作（计划为 Hadamard 变换编写定制的 Vulkan 计算着色器，进一步提高 t/s）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03263d7e9d45b0dc",
      "translationZh": "很想听听压缩和边缘 AI 社区对这种方法的看法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4802a41a2818525c",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Grouchy-Zebra9780 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
